    {
        "content": "<p>Hi, I am a complete beginner at lean I am currently on the lean number game trying to complete a proof by induction of add_right_cancel theorem, so far Ive done this:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">induction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span>\n<span class=\"n\">repeat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">add_zero</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span>\n<span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span>\n<span class=\"n\">repeat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">add_succ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">am</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trying</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">such_inj</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">on</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">goal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">so</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">that</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">it</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">agress</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">my</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">assumption</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">however</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nothing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">happening</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">am</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">I</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">going</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wrong?</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
