    {
        "content": "<p>Hi, thanks Robin.  I have tried those kinds of commands (exactly) and nothing happens.  I am not sure if it's the game, or the server, or what.  I had a similar problem with rfl not working, so I will try to give it another shot at resetting and rushing to the line in question without it crashing.</p>\n<p>Otherwise, I have noticed that I can solve these by going back up in my proof and unfolding it slightly differently, changing the order of things earlier on, but only if it sets the terms up so that I can use these associative/commutation commands from left to right, while avoiding more complex multivariate terms.</p>\n<p>I'm not sure at this point if that is how its supposed to work (in this game) but from your comment it seems unlikely.</p>",
